      "versionNonce": 1012, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1731000000000,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "⑥ Conversation 对话区\n（有会话 ShowEmptyState=false）\n\n[ 消息列表 ScrollViewer ]\n  ┌ 用户气泡 ┐\n  ┌ 助手气泡·Markdown ┐\n  ┌ 操作栏 复制/重生成/赞踩 ┐\n    MessageItemView × N\n\n[ ③ ComposerView 贴底 ]",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 19, "containerId": null, "originalText": "⑥ Conversation 对话区\n（有会话 ShowEmptyState=false）\n\n[ 消息列表 ScrollViewer ]\n  ┌ 用户气泡 ┐\n  ┌ 助手气泡·Markdown ┐\n  ┌ 操作栏 复制/重生成/赞踩 ┐\n    MessageItemView × N\n\n[ ③ ComposerView 贴底 ]", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
